{"id":"P077-1","subject":"P","unit":"P077","unitTitle":"2025 ① (1월~4월) · 25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P077-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n두 개의 백터가 , \n\n일 때, × 는?\n\n\n①       ② \n\n③      ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":444},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1085}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n\n그림과 같은 동심구도체의 정전용량이 일 때, 반지름\n\n, 를 2배, 를 4배, 비유전율 를 2배로 하면, 동심구\n\n도체의 정전용량은 ′가 된다고 한다.\n\n′와 의 관계는 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① ′        ② ′ \n\n③ ′        ④ ′ \n\n⑤ ′ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":818},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":225},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m02-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1466}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n면전하밀도가 Cm인 무한평면 도체로부터 10m\n\n떨어진 위치에 있는 C의 점전하가 있다. 이 점전하의\n\n작용 전기력은 몇 N 인가?\n\n\n                           \n①           ②                                   \n\n                           \n③           ④                                   \n\n    \n⑤      ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":478},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":418},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m03-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1252}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n\n비유전율이 인 유전체의 분극의 세기가         nCm\n일 때, 유전체에 가한 전계의 세기는 몇 Vm인가?\n                         \n(단, 진공중의 유전율은         Fm이다.)         \n\n\n① 0.01         ② 0.02\n\n③ 0.04         ④ 0.08\n\n⑤ 0.12","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":630},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":632}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n반지름이 1m인 접지구도체 중심으로부터 6m 떨어진\n\n점에 1C의 점전하가 있을 때, 접지구도체에는 ′의\n\n전하가 유도된다. 이 때, 와 ′간에 작용하는 힘은 몇\n\nN 인가?\n\n\n                              \n①            ②  \n\n                              \n③            ④  \n\n       \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":712},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m05-e2.webp","width":678,"height":871}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n진공중에서 점자하 , 가 m만큼 떨어져\n\n있을 때, 두 점자하간에는 N의 작용력이 작용한다.\n\n이 경우, 두 점자하간의 거리 m을 구하는 공식은?\n\n\n                       \n①            ②    × \n\n                  × \n③            ④        \n\n     \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":494},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":599}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n기자력이 100AT 인 환상 철심 내에 작용하는 자속이\n\n4일 때, 철심의 자기저항은 몇 AT인가?\n\n\n① 25          ② 50\n\n③ 100         ④ 200\n\n⑤ 400","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":415}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P077-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n자속밀도가 40m인 평등자계 내에서 16cm의\n직선 도체가 자계와 수직방향으로 ms로 이동할 때,\n\n직선 도체의 기전력이 32V였다. 이 때, 직선도체의 이동\n\n속도는 몇 ms인가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 4           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e10-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e10-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1154}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"tex